<title>USA: Northwest Airlines Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Northwest Airlines Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.58		    $0.41</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.52		    $0.37</p>
<p> Net			 64,600		   53,400</p>
<p> Revs		   2,375,500		2,264,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     103,600		   98,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     114,200		  108,300</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 oper revs include passenger revs of $2.04 billion vs $1.94 billion.</p>
